{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.poster.avif?t=1768013762\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.webm?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.mp4?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEMO AVAILABLE NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the entirety of Floor 1 with the free demo! Can you brave the unknown dangers of The Cube?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo will cover the entirety of Floor 1 and is available on standard (flatscreen) mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >==================================</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WARNING: Do not play if you\u2019re scared by squares.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scared by Squares is an exploration experience built entirely from cubes. Use your senses to navigate each room as you solve puzzles, survive platforming challenges, and hunt anomalies. What secrets will you uncover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game runs in both standard and VR modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.poster.avif?t=1768013762\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.webm?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/155997e330140b21589020d57b97abc2.mp4?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been sent into The Cube, a digital prison made of perfect squares, to investigate reports of corrupted geometry. Your mission: locate and cleanse all anomalies and restore balance before they consume everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.poster.avif?t=1768013762\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.webm?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/937cd48f9586ac3df155ce63c9592598.mp4?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Skill</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between mind-bending puzzles, hidden traps, and cubic enemies lurking around each corner, every room you enter offers a new challenge. Harness all your will, focus, and courage to make it through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/8fff294f548c9046e8a763da201df956.poster.avif?t=1768013762\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/8fff294f548c9046e8a763da201df956.webm?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/8fff294f548c9046e8a763da201df956.mp4?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt &amp; Overcome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ongoing developments bring new challenges to your experience within The Cube. More floors and puzzles, new anomalies, and features such as multiplayer will be added as The Cube continues to expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >==================================</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719480?t=1768013762","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/c16a0220089cb0ffafcfe96c53b87d0521a9c321/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768013762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/6f771645783e4d4261ac9b024adaf3adaf478487/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768013762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/6f771645783e4d4261ac9b024adaf3adaf478487/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768013762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4286600,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.poster.avif?t=1768013762\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719480/extras/ee3d7878302c50a3ad44ae3b6610999f.webm?t=1768013762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h